  "description": "AddStyloExtract() DI extensions for ASP.NET Core, including Markdown content negotiation middleware. The single package most apps want: brings in the full StyloExtract stack (Abstractions, Html, Fingerprint, Templates, Heuristics, Markdown, Core) wired through Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection. Opt-in middleware, a per-action attribute, and a Minimal API extension transparently convert HTML responses to Markdown when clients send Accept: text/markdown. Browser-friendly query-string Accept override (?format=markdown) and opt-in IDistributedCache support for repeat extractions (v1.1.0+).",
